TODO — Seq66 Loves SooperLooper

This fork does not use an unstructured root TODO list.

Active work is tracked in:

    doc/sooperlooper/WORK-QUEUE.md

Current project state and the active task are tracked in:

    PROJECT-MANIFEST.json
    doc/sooperlooper/checkpoints/CURRENT.md

Long-term phase order is tracked in:

    doc/sooperlooper/ROADMAP.md

Requirements and verification status are tracked in:

    doc/sooperlooper/SPECIFICATION.md
    doc/sooperlooper/TRACEABILITY.md

The large TODO previously inherited at this path belongs to upstream Seq66. It
remains unchanged on the upstream-mirror `master` branch and in
`ahlstromcj/seq66`.

Agents MUST NOT copy items from the upstream TODO into implementation work
without first creating a stable task ID, linking requirements and defining
acceptance tests in the fork control documents.

See also:

    doc/sooperlooper/DOCUMENTATION-MAP.md
    doc/sooperlooper/UPSTREAM-SYNC.md
    AGENTS.md
